      "id": "claim_e4c5c61f92024fc2a29a597e941f7c0e",
      "statement": "The learner-owned integration seam is `judge_score()`: it must use the separate judge client, apply an ambiguity-aware rubric, parse a 1–5 score tolerantly, and return `-1` rather than crash the dataset run when a judge response cannot be parsed.",
