      "id": "claim_03ebabd74af14a6aa350cf7bc7fdd3fc",
      "statement": "Each variant runner seeds the Langfuse dataset, binds a prompt and optional model into a Kiro task, executes `dataset.run_experiment()` with item and run evaluators, and writes a local variant summary for later comparison.",
