    {
      "id": "claim_0549bffa9efb4a6394a231e3d659487e",
      "statement": "Dataset seeding is designed to be repeatable: the dataset is created by name and each local item is upserted by ID; the bound task invokes Kiro once per dataset item, producing one task call per item.",
